                        </article>
                                                                            <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/0AEBADDEC1796E8A1E38573C5E5EB6D6">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/0AEBADDEC1796E8A1E38573C5E5EB6D6/a1998648cbd7aaf8dd51ab9b064eca84_512.webp" alt="沈富雄鐵口直斷「可能落選」　蔣萬安用4字回應" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/0AEBADDEC1796E8A1E38573C5E5EB6D6">沈富雄鐵口直斷「可能落選」　蔣萬安用4字回應</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者李俊毅／台北報導】年底選戰倒數40天，台北市長蔣萬安今天下午將正式宣布競總主委由台中市長盧秀燕擔任。不過，近來蔣萬安選情遭對手民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋猛打，前立委沈富雄昨日在政論節目中更示警，指「蔣萬安有可能落選」，引發討論。對此，蔣萬安今天上午出席活動受訪回應，面對每一次選戰特別今年格外艱辛、而且激烈，他「戒慎恐懼」。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T11:41:00+08:00">2026/10/19 11:41</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                                            <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/663DB0980E851B79F65EB3D95F095395">
                            <figure>
