                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/08B28F757AB0CBA8CF4A5A0972176C99/49c17e10964cc2ffe6cd9ec855d50b21_512.webp" alt="毒駕逆向「撞我媽媽」驚悚影片！陳聖文：毒品篩劑領取量為何這麼低？" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
