                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/802D4F51FBC434A132E08DD95CA23DA8/5035ea0b7a40902d2d76c7737bd32b6f_512.webp" alt="陳意涵產後遭租屋詐騙！劉冠廷拍嗝被兒子「頭槌攻擊」自創安全氣囊護臉" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
